CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.spin(p_menu text, p_user uuid DEFAULT NULL::uuid)
 RETURNS uuid
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
DECLARE
  v_date          date := (now() AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Seoul')::date;
  v_row           day_state%ROWTYPE;
  v_member_count  int;
  v_total         numeric;
  v_rand          numeric;
  v_cum           numeric := 0;
  v_picked        uuid;
  v_picked_found  boolean := false;
  rec             record;
BEGIN
  IF p_menu NOT IN ('meal', 'coffee', 'snack') THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'invalid menu: %', p_menu;
  END IF;

  SELECT count(*) INTO v_member_count FROM members;
  IF v_member_count = 0 THEN
    RETURN NULL;
  END IF;

  INSERT INTO day_state (date) VALUES (v_date)
  ON CONFLICT (date) DO NOTHING;

  SELECT * INTO v_row FROM day_state WHERE date = v_date FOR UPDATE;

  IF p_menu = 'meal' AND v_row.meal_spun THEN
    RETURN v_row.meal_payer;
  ELSIF p_menu = 'coffee' AND v_row.coffee_spun THEN
    RETURN v_row.coffee_payer;
  ELSIF p_menu = 'snack' AND v_row.snack_spun THEN
    RETURN v_row.snack_payer;
  END IF;

  SELECT coalesce(sum(weight), 0) INTO v_total FROM roulette_weights(p_menu);
  IF v_total <= 0 THEN
    RETURN NULL;
  END IF;

  v_rand := random() * v_total;

  FOR rec IN SELECT member_id, weight FROM roulette_weights(p_menu) ORDER BY member_id NULLS FIRST LOOP
    v_cum := v_cum + rec.weight;
    IF NOT v_picked_found AND v_rand <= v_cum THEN
      v_picked := rec.member_id;
      v_picked_found := true;
    END IF;
  END LOOP;

  IF p_menu = 'meal' THEN
    UPDATE day_state SET meal_payer = v_picked, meal_spun = true WHERE date = v_date;
  ELSIF p_menu = 'coffee' THEN
    UPDATE day_state SET coffee_payer = v_picked, coffee_spun = true WHERE date = v_date;
  ELSE
    UPDATE day_state SET snack_payer = v_picked, snack_spun = true WHERE date = v_date;
  END IF;

  RETURN v_picked;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.sync_member_to_team_log()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' THEN
    IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_log_members WHERE trim(name) = trim(NEW.name)) THEN
      INSERT INTO team_log_members (name, sort_order, color_key, member_id)
      VALUES (trim(NEW.name), COALESCE((SELECT max(sort_order) + 1 FROM team_log_members), 0), COALESCE(NEW.color_key, 0), NEW.id);
    ELSE
      UPDATE team_log_members SET member_id = NEW.id
      WHERE trim(name) = trim(NEW.name) AND member_id IS NULL
        AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_log_members t2 WHERE t2.member_id = NEW.id);
    END IF;
  ELSIF TG_OP = 'UPDATE' AND trim(NEW.name) != trim(OLD.name) THEN
    UPDATE team_log_members SET name = trim(NEW.name) WHERE trim(name) = trim(OLD.name);
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.sync_team_log_to_member()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  linked uuid;
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' THEN
    IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM members WHERE trim(name) = trim(NEW.name)) THEN
      INSERT INTO members (name, color_key) VALUES (trim(NEW.name), COALESCE(NEW.color_key, 0) % 8) RETURNING id INTO linked;
    ELSE
      SELECT id INTO linked FROM members WHERE trim(name) = trim(NEW.name) LIMIT 1;
    END IF;
    IF NEW.member_id IS NULL AND linked IS NOT NULL
       AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_log_members t2 WHERE t2.member_id = linked) THEN
      UPDATE team_log_members SET member_id = linked WHERE id = NEW.id;
    END IF;
  ELSIF TG_OP = 'UPDATE' AND trim(NEW.name) != trim(OLD.name) THEN
    UPDATE members SET name = trim(NEW.name) WHERE trim(name) = trim(OLD.name);
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_analysis_add(p_round uuid, p_source text, p_content text, p_based_on uuid, p_actor uuid)
 RETURNS uuid
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  r team_rounds%ROWTYPE;
  nv int;
  aid uuid;
BEGIN
  PERFORM team_analysis_require_lead(p_actor);
  SELECT * INTO r FROM team_rounds WHERE id = p_round FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT FOUND THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'round_not_found' USING ERRCODE = 'P0002'; END IF;
  IF r.closed_at IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'round_not_closed' USING ERRCODE = '42501'; END IF;
  IF p_based_on IS NOT NULL AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_round_analyses WHERE id = p_based_on AND round_id = p_round) THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'based_on_mismatch' USING ERRCODE = '22023';
  END IF;
  SELECT coalesce(max(version), 0) + 1 INTO nv FROM team_round_analyses WHERE round_id = p_round;
  INSERT INTO team_round_analyses (round_id, version, source, content, based_on, created_by)
  VALUES (p_round, nv, trim(p_source), p_content, p_based_on, p_actor)
  RETURNING id INTO aid;
  RETURN aid;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_analysis_publish(p_id uuid, p_actor uuid)
 RETURNS text
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  a team_round_analyses%ROWTYPE;
BEGIN
  PERFORM team_analysis_require_lead(p_actor);
  SELECT * INTO a FROM team_round_analyses WHERE id = p_id FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT FOUND THEN RETURN 'not_found'; END IF;
  IF a.status != 'draft' THEN RETURN 'not_draft'; END IF;
  UPDATE team_round_analyses SET status = 'superseded' WHERE round_id = a.round_id AND status = 'published';
  UPDATE team_round_analyses SET status = 'published', published_at = now(), published_by = p_actor WHERE id = p_id;
  RETURN 'published';
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_analysis_withdraw(p_id uuid, p_actor uuid)
 RETURNS text
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  a team_round_analyses%ROWTYPE;
BEGIN
  PERFORM team_analysis_require_lead(p_actor);
  SELECT * INTO a FROM team_round_analyses WHERE id = p_id FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT FOUND THEN RETURN 'not_found'; END IF;
  IF a.status NOT IN ('draft', 'published') THEN RETURN 'not_withdrawable'; END IF;
  UPDATE team_round_analyses SET status = 'withdrawn', withdrawn_at = now(), withdrawn_by = p_actor WHERE id = p_id;
  RETURN 'withdrawn';
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_plan_actions_guard()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'DELETE' THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_plan_actions: actions are kept as history and cannot be deleted (use status on_hold)' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF NEW.month_id IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.month_id OR NEW.category IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.category
     OR NEW.seed_key IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.seed_key OR NEW.created_at IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.created_at THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_plan_actions: month and category are fixed' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_plan_months_guard()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'DELETE' THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_plan_months: plan months are kept as history and cannot be deleted' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF NEW.month IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.month OR NEW.created_at IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.created_at THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_plan_months: month is fixed' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_responses_guard()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'DELETE' THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_responses: responses are kept as history and cannot be deleted' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_rounds r WHERE r.id = NEW.round_id AND r.closed_at IS NOT NULL) THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_responses: the round is closed' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'UPDATE' AND (NEW.round_id IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.round_id OR NEW.member_id IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.member_id) THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_responses: round and member cannot change' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_round_analyses_guard()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'DELETE' THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_round_analyses: versions are kept as history and cannot be deleted' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF NEW.content IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.content OR NEW.source IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.source OR NEW.round_id IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.round_id
     OR NEW.version IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.version OR NEW.created_by IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.created_by OR NEW.based_on IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.based_on
     OR NEW.created_at IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.created_at THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_round_analyses: a saved version cannot be edited - add a new version' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF NEW.status IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.status AND NOT (
       (OLD.status = 'draft' AND NEW.status IN ('published', 'withdrawn'))
    OR (OLD.status = 'published' AND NEW.status IN ('superseded', 'withdrawn'))) THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_round_analyses: status % cannot change to %', OLD.status, NEW.status USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF (NEW.published_at IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.published_at OR NEW.published_by IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.published_by)
     AND NOT (OLD.status = 'draft' AND NEW.status = 'published') THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_round_analyses: publish stamp only changes when a draft is published' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF (NEW.withdrawn_at IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.withdrawn_at OR NEW.withdrawn_by IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.withdrawn_by)
     AND NOT (NEW.status = 'withdrawn' AND OLD.status != 'withdrawn') THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_round_analyses: withdraw stamp only changes when a version is withdrawn' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_round_close(p_round uuid, p_reason text, p_result jsonb, p_as_of timestamp with time zone, p_n integer, p_actor uuid)
 RETURNS text
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  r team_rounds%ROWTYPE;
  cnt int;
  latest timestamptz;
BEGIN
  SELECT * INTO r FROM team_rounds WHERE id = p_round FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT FOUND THEN RETURN 'not_found'; END IF;
  IF r.closed_at IS NOT NULL THEN RETURN 'already_closed'; END IF;
  SELECT count(*), max(coalesce(updated_at, submitted_at)) INTO cnt, latest FROM team_responses WHERE round_id = p_round;
  IF cnt != p_n OR (latest IS NOT NULL AND latest > p_as_of) THEN RETURN 'stale'; END IF;

  IF r.kind = 'baseline' AND cardinality(r.roster) > cnt THEN RETURN 'not_all_submitted'; END IF;
  IF cnt = 0 THEN RETURN 'no_responses'; END IF;

  UPDATE team_rounds SET closed_at = now(), close_reason = p_reason, result = p_result WHERE id = p_round;
  INSERT INTO team_events (type, actor_id, round_id, dedupe_key, payload)
  VALUES ('round_closed', p_actor, p_round, 'round_closed:' || p_round,
          jsonb_build_object('reason', p_reason, 'n', cnt, 'roster_n', cardinality(r.roster)));
  RETURN 'closed';
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_round_exclude_member(p_round uuid, p_member uuid, p_reason text, p_actor uuid)
 RETURNS jsonb
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  r team_rounds%ROWTYPE;
BEGIN
  IF coalesce(trim(p_reason), '') = '' THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'reason_required' USING ERRCODE = '22023'; END IF;
  SELECT * INTO r FROM team_rounds WHERE id = p_round FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT FOUND THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'round_not_found' USING ERRCODE = 'P0002'; END IF;
  IF r.closed_at IS NOT NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'round_closed' USING ERRCODE = '42501'; END IF;
  IF NOT (p_member = ANY (r.roster)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'not_in_roster' USING ERRCODE = '22023'; END IF;
  IF EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_responses WHERE round_id = p_round AND member_id = p_member) THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'already_submitted' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF NOT (cardinality(r.roster) > 1) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'roster_would_be_empty' USING ERRCODE = '22023'; END IF;
  PERFORM set_config('hrm.roster_exception', p_round::text, true);
  UPDATE team_rounds SET roster = array_remove(roster, p_member) WHERE id = p_round;
  PERFORM set_config('hrm.roster_exception', '', true);
  INSERT INTO team_events (type, actor_id, member_id, round_id, dedupe_key, payload)
  VALUES ('roster_changed', p_actor, p_member, p_round, 'roster_excluded:' || p_round || ':' || p_member,
          jsonb_build_object('op', 'exclude', 'reason', trim(p_reason), 'roster_n', cardinality(r.roster) - 1));
  RETURN jsonb_build_object('roster_n', cardinality(r.roster) - 1,
    'submitted_n', (SELECT count(*) FROM team_responses WHERE round_id = p_round));
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_round_open(p_kind text, p_title text, p_items jsonb, p_items_version text, p_roster uuid[], p_closes_at timestamp with time zone, p_actor uuid)
 RETURNS uuid
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  rid uuid;
BEGIN
  IF p_kind NOT IN ('baseline', 'periodic') THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'only diagnosis rounds can be opened here' USING ERRCODE = '22023';
  END IF;
  INSERT INTO team_rounds (kind, title, items, items_version, roster, closes_at, created_by)
  VALUES (p_kind, p_title, p_items, p_items_version, p_roster, p_closes_at, p_actor)
  RETURNING id INTO rid;
  INSERT INTO team_events (type, actor_id, round_id, dedupe_key, payload)
  VALUES ('round_opened', p_actor, rid, 'round_opened:' || rid,
          jsonb_build_object('kind', p_kind, 'roster_n', cardinality(p_roster), 'items_version', p_items_version));
  RETURN rid;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_round_submit(p_round uuid, p_member uuid, p_items_version text, p_answers jsonb)
 RETURNS jsonb
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  r team_rounds%ROWTYPE;
  is_first boolean;
  submitted int;
BEGIN
  SELECT * INTO r FROM team_rounds WHERE id = p_round FOR SHARE;
  IF NOT FOUND THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'round_not_found' USING ERRCODE = 'P0002'; END IF;
  IF r.closed_at IS NOT NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'round_closed' USING ERRCODE = '42501'; END IF;
  IF NOT (p_member = ANY (r.roster)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'not_in_roster' USING ERRCODE = '42501'; END IF;
  IF p_items_version IS DISTINCT FROM r.items_version THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'version_mismatch' USING ERRCODE = '22023'; END IF;

  is_first := NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM team_responses WHERE round_id = p_round AND member_id = p_member);
  INSERT INTO team_responses (round_id, member_id, items_version, answers)
  VALUES (p_round, p_member, p_items_version, p_answers)
  ON CONFLICT (round_id, member_id) DO UPDATE SET answers = EXCLUDED.answers, updated_at = now();

  SELECT count(*) INTO submitted FROM team_responses WHERE round_id = p_round;
  IF is_first THEN
    INSERT INTO team_events (type, actor_id, member_id, round_id, dedupe_key, payload)
    VALUES ('response_submitted', p_member, p_member, p_round, 'submitted:' || p_round || ':' || p_member,
            jsonb_build_object('submitted_n', submitted, 'roster_n', cardinality(r.roster)))
    ON CONFLICT (dedupe_key) DO NOTHING;
  END IF;
  RETURN jsonb_build_object('submitted_n', submitted, 'roster_n', cardinality(r.roster), 'first', is_first);
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.team_rounds_guard()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'DELETE' THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_rounds: rounds are kept as history and cannot be deleted' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF OLD.closed_at IS NOT NULL THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_rounds: a closed round is read-only' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  IF NEW.items IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.items OR NEW.items_version IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.items_version OR NEW.kind IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.kind THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_rounds: items and kind are fixed when a round opens' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  -- 명단은 예외 절차(team_round_exclude_member)에서만, 줄이는 방향으로만 바뀐다.
  IF NEW.roster IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.roster AND (
       coalesce(current_setting('hrm.roster_exception', true), '') != OLD.id::text
       OR NOT (OLD.roster @> NEW.roster) OR cardinality(NEW.roster) = 0) THEN
    RAISE EXCEPTION 'team_rounds: roster can only shrink through team_round_exclude_member()' USING ERRCODE = '42501';
  END IF;
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$

CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.work_styles_log_change()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
 SECURITY DEFINER
 SET search_path TO 'public'
AS $function$
DECLARE
  changed text[] := ARRAY[]::text[];
  src text := nullif(current_setting('hrm.event_source', true), '');
BEGIN
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.gives_tags IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.gives_tags THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'gives_tags'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.needs_tags IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.needs_tags THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'needs_tags'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.when_stuck IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.when_stuck THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'when_stuck'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.feedback_pref IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.feedback_pref THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'feedback_pref'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.focus_time IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.focus_time THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'focus_time'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.meeting_pref IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.meeting_pref THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'meeting_pref'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.growth_edge IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.growth_edge THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'growth_edge'); END IF;
  IF TG_OP = 'INSERT' OR NEW.team_request IS DISTINCT FROM OLD.team_request THEN changed := array_append(changed, 'team_request'); END IF;
  IF cardinality(changed) = 0 THEN RETURN NEW; END IF;
  INSERT INTO team_events (type, member_id, round_id, dedupe_key, payload)
  VALUES ('profile_updated', NEW.member_id,
          CASE WHEN src LIKE 'round:%' THEN substring(src FROM 7)::uuid END,
          'profile:' || gen_random_uuid(),
          jsonb_build_object('fields', to_jsonb(changed), 'source', coalesce(src, 'profile')));
  RETURN NEW;
END;
$function$
